{"v":4,"catch":"跪在我面前！ \n一個陌生的新領主首次亮相。","desc":"《PISTOL DAIMYO NO BOUKEN》是 NAMCO 於 1990 年發行的射擊遊戲。\n玩家控制年輕的領主“PISTOL DAIMYO”進行冒險，與他戰鬥，精神和邪惡。\n他的能量子彈有 3 層強度，取決於你按住按鈕的時間。 使用沿途發現的有用物品，戰勝面前的敵人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-01-27","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aed00bc0869735b2f53f784af9849b90176cb5f518a0ed10108bed1e47ffeaf4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7fb939f6288a15b1db52c4d091f9401553ab4a5ab8360c0e4a4bbf1e1a9334c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49f9f62402bab0d53a881706733aa16b2be75e5342d25fe92f76d01c1ecbc25b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df3850beed4fd183c19936ccbbea0a76c83dec8429d4d841f171e3c41355bb8a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c743e35b2da68a8056519b3a32be08fff850c7af073ded26459698f2f1c0c54a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/871b1b631bacdd7c9a818ffdc22708d08e1f99542ca8a0bfc6aace3c8607c36e.jpg"],"titleId":"010091e016a08000","dlc":[]}